WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:02.970
Weather radar, check!

00:03.020 --> 00:05.480
<b>Kaminoi Zoo
Guide Map</b>

00:03.480 --> 00:04.960
Walking route, check!

00:05.970 --> 00:07.600
Personal stuff, check!

00:08.210 --> 00:10.580
Ichiro, how is lunch?

00:10.580 --> 00:11.800
O-Okay!

00:12.200 --> 00:14.060
Fumio, the Zoopedia?

00:12.610 --> 00:15.240
<b>Zoopedia</b>

00:14.060 --> 00:15.240
Okay.

00:17.020 --> 00:19.340
The trip to the zoo, take two!

00:21.730 --> 00:23.690
Good thing the weather's nice today.

00:24.270 --> 00:28.340
Oh, yeah. It was horrible yesterday.

00:33.430 --> 00:36.970
It was like a driving range out there.

00:36.970 --> 00:38.670
A "driving rain."

00:38.670 --> 00:41.180
If it's "range," that has to do with golf.

00:43.350 --> 00:45.100
<b>Zoopedia</b>

00:45.100 --> 00:50.100
<b>Zoopedia</b>

00:45.980 --> 00:49.540
Fumio, let's leave the Zoopedia here today.

00:49.540 --> 00:50.650
It's heavy.

00:52.110 --> 00:54.610
<b>Zoopedia</b>

00:52.480 --> 00:54.360
Let's take this small one.

00:56.660 --> 00:57.530
Yeah.

00:59.490 --> 01:00.980
Good morning.

01:01.750 --> 01:03.620
Goshiki-san, good morning!

01:03.620 --> 01:04.770
Morning.

01:06.480 --> 01:09.240
It's fine weather for going out today.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.410
Oh, hey!

01:11.410 --> 01:13.170
Want to come with us, Goshiki-san?

01:13.520 --> 01:16.280
I'll show you around!

01:16.280 --> 01:17.630
Well!

01:17.630 --> 01:18.580
Listen.

01:19.530 --> 01:25.030
The zoo is nearby, so I don't think there'd 
be any retribution, but if you'd like...

01:26.800 --> 01:29.890
Would you like to go out with me?

01:33.860 --> 01:35.040
<i>We're...</i>

01:36.580 --> 01:38.280
<i>We're...</i>

01:38.280 --> 01:40.480
<i>...going out!</i>

01:40.480 --> 01:42.810
<i>...getting started with dating.</i>

01:45.930 --> 01:50.290
<i>Does that mean this will be 
our first genuine date?!</i>

01:51.090 --> 01:52.310
I'll go!

01:53.200 --> 01:54.200
Okay!

01:54.540 --> 01:57.600
Then make your own lunch.

01:57.600 --> 02:00.010
Put whatever you like on a sandwich.

02:00.010 --> 02:01.700
Ham, ham, cheese.

02:01.700 --> 02:03.210
And we have sides.

02:04.910 --> 02:09.220
<i>I guess it'd be best to tell 
Machi and Fumio that we're dating.</i>

02:14.760 --> 02:18.080
<i>For that matter, Goshiki-san's background...</i>

02:18.080 --> 02:20.480
<i>The engagement, the rules system...</i>

02:20.840 --> 02:23.490
<i>How do I explain all that?</i>

02:28.540 --> 02:31.050
Come on, Ichiro. Pack your tea.

02:31.050 --> 02:32.430
Oh, right!

02:32.750 --> 02:36.040
<i>Forget it, I can't find the words.</i>

02:36.490 --> 02:38.480
What would you like, Goshiki-san?

02:36.870 --> 02:39.980
<i>Yet I was brave enough to 
confess my love yesterday.</i>

02:38.480 --> 02:39.310
Like.

02:39.310 --> 02:42.700
Me? I like them all.

02:41.910 --> 02:43.420
<i>I need to do this right.</i>

04:17.980 --> 04:22.990
<b><b>Episode 5</b></b>

04:17.980 --> 04:22.990
<b><b>At the Zoo</b></b>

04:17.980 --> 04:22.990
<b><b>with the Princess</b></b>

04:31.730 --> 04:33.430
We made it!

04:31.750 --> 04:34.750
<b>Kaminoi Zoo</b>

04:33.430 --> 04:34.750
Made it.

04:36.490 --> 04:39.040
Wow, so this is a zoo!

04:46.800 --> 04:48.960
Goshiki-san, let's take a picture!

04:51.220 --> 04:52.870
Ready, sir!

04:53.770 --> 04:55.020
<b>Kaminoi Zoo
Guide Map</b>

04:55.600 --> 04:56.330
There.

04:56.860 --> 04:58.810
You need one with 
no people in it too, right?

04:59.210 --> 05:00.770
As a manga reference.

05:00.770 --> 05:03.790
I don't plan on using it,
 but you never know.

05:05.600 --> 05:07.760
<i>Machi-san thinks like a manga artist.</i>

05:13.440 --> 05:15.420
First we get tickets for the pandas.

05:15.420 --> 05:16.670
All right.

05:17.780 --> 05:21.480
I need info on the baby giraffe 
feeding time and the petting zoo!

05:21.480 --> 05:23.830
If they do it around 11:30AM,

05:23.830 --> 05:26.810
we should go to the petting zoo, 
then to the giraffes later.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.310
Copy that.

05:28.630 --> 05:31.800
In-between, let's walk around in these zones.

05:31.800 --> 05:32.760
Copy.

05:33.630 --> 05:40.050
Ah, so you map out a strategy rather than 
just going from one end to the other.

05:40.470 --> 05:43.360
We had no plan yesterday, 
and we got rained out.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.870
Lesson learned.

05:44.870 --> 05:46.450
Lesson learned.

05:47.340 --> 05:49.700
Haven't you ever been to a zoo, Goshiki-san?

05:50.140 --> 05:51.340
I haven't.

05:51.340 --> 05:56.080
But there are many animals on the 
island, so I am used to them.

05:56.080 --> 05:57.610
Oh, yeah?

05:57.610 --> 05:59.450
Well, let's set out!

05:59.450 --> 06:00.590
Out.

06:01.990 --> 06:03.290
Yes, let's.

06:14.870 --> 06:21.460
Now I finally get why so many dates 
in shojo manga are at the zoo!

06:31.620 --> 06:33.860
<i>I'm glad she's enjoying herself.</i>

06:45.570 --> 06:48.790
<i>M-Maybe I could hold hands, too!</i>

06:48.790 --> 06:50.760
<i>Because we're dating!</i>

06:48.920 --> 06:55.260
Because we're dating.

06:50.760 --> 06:51.720
<i>Because we're dating!</i>

06:51.390 --> 06:55.260
—Shiori Goshiki

06:51.720 --> 06:52.760
<i>Because we're dating!</i>

06:52.760 --> 06:53.850
<i>Because we're dating!</i>

06:53.850 --> 06:55.250
<i>Because we're dating!</i>

07:07.440 --> 07:08.970
<i>His hands are full.</i>

07:11.240 --> 07:14.910
<i>Uh oh, I haven't gotten 
to talk to her at all.</i>

07:15.520 --> 07:21.620
<i>Oh no, I may have given him the idea I want
him holding </i>my<i> hand instead of theirs.</i>

07:23.580 --> 07:25.200
<i>Now what do I do?</i>

07:26.550 --> 07:28.800
Petting Zoo

07:32.660 --> 07:35.420
Oh my, you can hold guinea pigs.

07:35.720 --> 07:41.300
Hold them gently from behind like this,
 then lower them onto your lap.

07:41.300 --> 07:42.690
Yes, sir!

07:45.820 --> 07:49.030
It's so cute! And warm!

07:49.030 --> 07:50.810
It <i>is</i> cute.

07:58.460 --> 07:59.740
So cute!

08:03.340 --> 08:06.220
Go on, Fumio. It's okay.

08:11.900 --> 08:14.420
<i>Is he still not ready this year?</i>

08:14.710 --> 08:16.190
Want me to do it?

08:17.760 --> 08:18.980
Fumio-san.

08:21.630 --> 08:24.680
Animals pick up on fear.

08:25.500 --> 08:28.500
Let's find one that's likely 
to let you pick it up.

08:32.720 --> 08:35.450
There, that's the one.

08:38.620 --> 08:39.800
Very good.

08:43.520 --> 08:44.780
I'll hold one, too!

08:52.770 --> 08:56.650
You have to show respect, even if 
they don't understand your words.

09:00.470 --> 09:02.550
Wash thoroughly.

09:00.470 --> 09:03.980
Wash your
hands properly.

09:02.550 --> 09:03.970
Okay.

09:03.980 --> 09:05.720
hands properly.

09:03.980 --> 09:09.980
Wash your

09:09.030 --> 09:09.990
Huh?

09:11.560 --> 09:13.480
Is he lost?

09:15.450 --> 09:16.590
What's wrong?

09:17.080 --> 09:18.730
Where are the folks you came with?

09:19.630 --> 09:21.090
Wataru!

09:22.370 --> 09:24.190
Daddy!

09:24.190 --> 09:26.100
You shouldn't wander off.

09:28.420 --> 09:29.920
I didn't need to bother.

09:30.950 --> 09:32.430
You had the wrong idea!

09:32.430 --> 09:34.750
I hope I didn't scare him.

09:34.750 --> 09:36.590
No, it was lovely.

09:36.590 --> 09:40.920
If I were lost, your kindness 
would make me happy.

09:42.880 --> 09:45.310
Goshiki-san, you're exaggerating—

09:55.640 --> 09:57.810
Uh, what?

09:58.680 --> 10:00.610
You two are like...

10:04.590 --> 10:05.980
Did something happen?

10:06.450 --> 10:08.970
<i>Machi's too sharp!</i>

10:09.630 --> 10:11.950
I'm surprised you could tell.

10:12.300 --> 10:16.100
<i>Goshiki-san! We were </i>so<i> obvious!</i>

10:16.100 --> 10:18.280
Y-You've got it wrong, Machi!

10:18.280 --> 10:20.160
We weren't keeping it a secret!

10:20.160 --> 10:24.660
We only technically started dating 
yesterday, or maybe today!

10:24.660 --> 10:26.110
You're dating?!

10:30.730 --> 10:31.780
No way!

10:31.780 --> 10:35.370
Oh man, putting the moves on your <i>assistant?</i>

10:35.370 --> 10:37.340
That's horrible! Doomed to fail!

10:37.610 --> 10:39.610
Th-This means...!

10:39.950 --> 10:41.610
That's great!

10:42.780 --> 10:44.860
Your first girlfriend?

10:44.860 --> 10:48.130
And it's Goshiki-san?! Yay!

10:50.820 --> 10:53.580
W-We won't go overboard while we're working,

10:53.580 --> 10:56.280
or when we're at the apartment house!

10:56.630 --> 10:58.040
Right, Goshiki-san?

10:58.040 --> 11:01.620
That's right! Holding hands? 
That'd be ridiculous!

11:02.650 --> 11:04.580
You could at least hold hands.

11:04.580 --> 11:06.390
Even grade schoolers do that.

11:06.390 --> 11:08.770
B-But...

11:09.800 --> 11:12.230
If this is a date, were we in the way?

11:13.140 --> 11:14.900
You're not in the way!

11:17.100 --> 11:19.110
You're absolutely not in the way.

11:20.460 --> 11:22.840
You don't need to look so serious.

11:24.000 --> 11:27.920
You could even say <i>I'm</i> in 
the way of a family event.

11:28.610 --> 11:31.540
No, you're not! I invited you, didn't I?!

11:31.540 --> 11:33.290
Both of you!

11:37.590 --> 11:39.810
Machi-san, Fumio-san.

11:39.810 --> 11:45.040
Kuga-san told me that you two 
are the most important to him.

11:47.550 --> 11:51.810
Would you let me have some of his time, too?

11:54.320 --> 11:57.330
Wh-What a question to ask!

11:57.960 --> 11:58.800
Sure.

12:00.910 --> 12:01.990
That's fine.

12:11.440 --> 12:12.510
Well...

12:13.590 --> 12:14.710
Machi.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.060
Fumio.

12:18.150 --> 12:19.530
And Goshiki-san.

12:20.830 --> 12:22.280
I'll treasure all of you.

12:23.700 --> 12:25.210
I promise.

12:25.450 --> 12:28.380
Look, you don't have to 
get so serious about it.

12:35.190 --> 12:37.230
We already knew that.

12:37.230 --> 12:38.480
Knew that.

12:42.330 --> 12:43.970
Come on, Fumio.

12:45.880 --> 12:48.140
Let's go! It's panda time!

12:48.140 --> 12:48.850
Sure.

12:50.530 --> 12:52.620
Okay, let's go!

12:55.250 --> 12:56.500
Say...

12:58.320 --> 13:02.360
Goshiki-san, what is it 
you like about Ichiro?

13:02.360 --> 13:05.760
Well, it's hard to sum up.

13:06.000 --> 13:08.500
Machi, don't pester her!

13:08.770 --> 13:11.220
Shoot, he overheard me.

13:20.850 --> 13:25.350
<i>What is it Kuga-san likes about </i>me?<i></i>

13:29.990 --> 13:33.000
<b>Kaminoi Zoo</b>

13:51.850 --> 13:54.490
Oh, feeding time's gonna start!

14:02.300 --> 14:04.890
I've never seen giraffes before!

14:04.890 --> 14:06.980
They're so adorable!

14:06.980 --> 14:08.520
That they are!

14:08.520 --> 14:11.500
It's my first time seeing a young one!

14:16.930 --> 14:18.630
Such long lashes.

14:19.050 --> 14:20.300
Did you see the tongues?

14:21.400 --> 14:23.130
They're totally purple.

14:23.130 --> 14:26.360
<i>They're going to hold still for a while.</i>

14:32.810 --> 14:34.590
H-Hey...

14:36.470 --> 14:39.400
So, what you said earlier...

14:39.840 --> 14:41.430
It made me happy.

14:42.270 --> 14:43.330
Thank you.

14:44.480 --> 14:46.910
I was happy, too.

14:46.910 --> 14:49.370
That the two of them accepted us.

14:50.300 --> 14:52.100
And for your promise.

14:53.030 --> 15:01.050
Machi, Fumio, and Goshiki-san. 
I'll treasure all of you. I promise.

15:05.310 --> 15:06.230
Kuga-san!

15:06.230 --> 15:06.960
Yes?!

15:08.070 --> 15:11.180
Would you hold hands with me?

15:12.650 --> 15:17.960
I suspect if we could do that while watching 
the giraffes, it would be the best feeling ever!

15:19.760 --> 15:22.100
<i>I was thinking the same thing.</i>

16:02.460 --> 16:03.890
They're holding hands!

16:09.050 --> 16:10.960
Goshiki-san, are you okay?!

16:10.960 --> 16:12.670
Wh-What's wrong?!

16:12.670 --> 16:13.940
What's wrong?

16:15.280 --> 16:19.550
Nothing, it just occurred 
to me that I'm truly happy.

16:19.550 --> 16:21.080
Oh, okay.

16:21.080 --> 16:21.950
Right!

16:22.470 --> 16:24.610
I'm happy, too!

16:24.610 --> 16:26.460
Happy.

16:43.820 --> 16:47.260
Well? Have you heard anything from Shiori?

16:47.750 --> 16:48.730
No.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.080
Oh.

16:50.550 --> 16:51.490
Komaki.

16:51.490 --> 16:52.440
Yes, ma'am.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.500
Makado.

16:53.500 --> 16:54.490
Yes, ma'am.

16:54.490 --> 16:56.100
Has any word reached you?

16:56.580 --> 16:57.860
No, ma'am.

16:57.860 --> 16:59.240
Nothing, ma'am.

16:59.790 --> 17:01.300
I see.

17:04.890 --> 17:07.190
I wonder if the princess is doing well.

17:07.550 --> 17:10.870
I haven't heard her voice at all lately.

17:10.870 --> 17:13.590
I'm sure it's a matter of distance.

17:13.590 --> 17:16.530
She's too far away to connect.

17:16.530 --> 17:17.460
But...

17:17.880 --> 17:22.730
Well, they say "No news is good news."

17:22.730 --> 17:25.710
I'm sure Shiori's doing quite well.

17:25.710 --> 17:27.420
I think so, too.

17:27.730 --> 17:28.930
Doing well?

17:29.550 --> 17:33.260
She's probably just wandering 
around aimlessly.

17:33.690 --> 17:34.910
Miyako...

17:36.200 --> 17:39.660
And making us worry so.

17:42.720 --> 17:50.020
Both of you, if you hear anything from Shiori, 
do not hesitate to inform us.

17:50.020 --> 17:51.290
Understood.

18:02.870 --> 18:04.390
We're home!

18:04.390 --> 18:05.710
Home.

18:07.770 --> 18:10.070
That was so much fun!

18:16.100 --> 18:18.260
That took all my energy...

18:20.270 --> 18:24.590
<i>It's blank! Reality calls!</i>

18:28.410 --> 18:31.340
<i>I might as well wash out the lunch box.</i>

18:32.340 --> 18:37.880
<i>Machi, this is not me procrastinating 
with chores. It must be done.</i>

18:41.350 --> 18:42.850
As for Kuga-san...

18:43.990 --> 18:48.520
What?! What is it about me he's fallen for?!

18:50.290 --> 18:54.880
You know, I haven't had him tell 
me specifically. It bothers me!

18:58.270 --> 18:59.610
I know.

19:00.150 --> 19:01.770
I'll go ask him!

19:03.850 --> 19:04.970
Kuga-san.

19:08.240 --> 19:10.210
Is he not in?

19:17.260 --> 19:18.870
What's going on?

19:18.870 --> 19:21.750
Oh, n-nothing!

19:21.750 --> 19:23.720
H-How about you, Chihiro-san?

19:24.420 --> 19:26.500
I was going to brew some tea.

19:26.500 --> 19:28.790
T-Tea?

19:28.790 --> 19:30.890
That sounds lovely.

19:32.040 --> 19:34.140
Did you need something from Ichiro-kun?

19:34.140 --> 19:38.140
Sort of. I need to check something.

19:38.420 --> 19:41.160
Check? For work?

19:42.210 --> 19:47.910
W-Well... I'm not sure I'd call it work.

19:48.170 --> 19:53.700
Um... Are you and Ichiro-kun...

19:54.100 --> 19:55.810
Y-Yes?

19:58.960 --> 20:01.270
No, never mind!

20:01.270 --> 20:04.030
If you need Ichiro-kun, 
he's in the dining room!

20:08.320 --> 20:11.140
Sh-She startled me.

20:14.450 --> 20:17.620
Oh, look where he fell asleep.

20:20.950 --> 20:24.300
The back of his neck is nice, 
like a giraffe's.

20:34.570 --> 20:35.850
<i>No!</i>

20:36.700 --> 20:40.100
I never thought you were the type to touch 
someone's body while they're asleep!

20:42.120 --> 20:44.560
<i>I nearly did it without thinking!</i>

20:45.440 --> 20:50.020
<i>Huh? But we're dating now, 
so it's different, right?</i>

20:50.020 --> 20:53.110
<i>No, we haven't reached that point yet.</i>

20:58.420 --> 21:02.490
K-Kuga-san, would you mind waking up?

21:03.330 --> 21:06.090
Oh, sorry.

21:06.090 --> 21:07.670
I fell asleep for a moment.

21:07.670 --> 21:10.230
There's nothing wrong with you sleeping.

21:10.230 --> 21:13.480
But I do think you should do it in bed.

21:14.090 --> 21:16.440
Um, listen.

21:17.070 --> 21:20.250
Is it all right if I touch the 
back of your neck for a bit?

21:21.280 --> 21:24.010
Sure, go ahead.

21:25.860 --> 21:27.700
Thank you!

21:31.360 --> 21:32.500
Hey...

21:33.090 --> 21:35.660
You don't have to ask just for that.

21:35.660 --> 21:37.520
Well, yes, but...

21:38.130 --> 21:44.740
Even if it's less than perfect, I figured I owe
 someone important to me full disclosure.

21:48.410 --> 21:49.430
Okay.

21:53.790 --> 21:56.540
<i>I-I can't move.</i>

22:07.530 --> 22:09.370
I forgot to ask!

22:09.370 --> 22:13.170
What is it Kuga-san likes about me?!

23:45.820 --> 23:48.810
Ichiro really is a poor talker.

23:48.810 --> 23:49.320
Yeah.

23:49.320 --> 23:53.120
He's nice and thoughtful enough, 
but he has trouble expressing it.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.040
I like him, though.

23:55.040 --> 23:55.950
Me, too!

23:55.950 --> 23:59.090
I wonder if Goshiki-san gets how he feels.

23:55.950 --> 23:59.950
<b>Episode 6</b>

23:55.950 --> 23:59.950
<b><b>A Letter with the Princess</b></b>
